    <Mugirl.SlaveApparelDef ParentName="Mugirl_BrainWashApparel">
        <defName>Mugirl_BrainwashHelmet</defName>
        <!-- 雪牛娘 洗脑头盔 -->
        <label>Mugirl Brainwashing Helmet</label>
        <!-- 由太空巨企研发的高级精神控制装置，外观是一款紧贴头部的全封闭头盔。其内部会释放特定光波、影像与音频，对佩戴者进行深层感官刺激与心理暗示，逐步瓦解自我意识并重塑忠诚。在洗脑过程中，雪牛娘的瞳孔会被强光反射，表情僵硬而恍惚，呼吸急促，仿佛陷入一种无法抗拒的快感与恐惧交织的状态。若被强制使用在非巨企派系个体上，他们会因精神崩溃而疯狂攻击附近生物。解除束缚需要[高科技束具钥匙]，而在解锁后还可通过[束具破解器]进行破解。破解后的头盔会根据佩戴者身份产生不同效果：对于囚犯，每次洗脑都会削弱其逃跑的意志，三次后将被彻底转化为奴隶；对于奴隶，每次洗脑会加深压制感，三次后将完全顺服，不再萌生越狱之心；而对于殖民者，每次洗脑会赋予一种诡异的愉悦情绪，三次后其性格将被永久改变，即便在精神崩溃时也不会再伤害同伴。 -->
        <description>An advanced mind-control device developed by a space-age megacorporation, appearing as a tightly-fitted, fully enclosed helmet. Its interior emits specific light waves, visuals, and audio to deliver deep sensory stimulation and psychological suggestion, gradually eroding the wearer's self-awareness and reshaping loyalty. During the brainwashing process, the Mugirl's pupils reflect intense light, her expression becomes stiff and dazed, and her breathing turns rapid, as if caught in a state of irrepressible pleasure intertwined with fear. If forcibly used on individuals from non-megacorporation factions, they will suffer mental breakdowns and frantically attack nearby creatures. Removal requires a [Spacer Restraint Key], and after unlocking, the device can be further decoded using a [Restraint Decryptor]. The decoded helmet produces different effects depending on the wearer's status: for prisoners, each brainwashing session weakens their will to escape, with three sessions resulting in complete conversion to slavery; for slaves, each session deepens their sense of suppression, with three sessions leading to total submission and elimination of escape desires; for colonists, each session induces an eerie euphoria, with three sessions permanently altering their personality, preventing them from harming other pawns even during mental breaks.</description>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Apparel/Mugirl_SlaveApparel/Mugirl_BrainwashHelmet/Mugirl_BrainwashHelmet</texPath>
        </graphicData>
        <costList>
            <ComponentSpacer>6</ComponentSpacer>
            <Plasteel>150</Plasteel>
            <Uranium>50</Uranium>
        </costList>
        <statBases>
            <MaxHitPoints>250</MaxHitPoints>
            <Flammability>0.5</Flammability>
            <DeteriorationRate>1.0</DeteriorationRate>
            <Beauty>-6</Beauty>
            <MarketValue>550</MarketValue>
            <Mass>4</Mass>
        </statBases>
        <apparel>
            <parentTagDef>ApparelHead</parentTagDef>
            <useWornGraphicMask>true</useWornGraphicMask>
            <bodyPartGroups>
                <li>HeadAttackTool</li>
            </bodyPartGroups>
            <wornGraphicPath>Things/Apparel/Mugirl_SlaveApparel/Mugirl_BrainwashHelmet/Mugirl_BrainwashHelmet</wornGraphicPath>
            <layers>
                <li>Overhead</li>
            </layers>
        </apparel>
        <BoundBodyPartGroupDefs>
            <li>HeadAttackTool</li>
        </BoundBodyPartGroupDefs>
        <comps>
            <li Class="Mugirl.CompProperties_BrainwashHelmet">
                <defaultHediff>Mugirl_BrainWashing_Level1</defaultHediff>
                <blockHediff>Mugirl_BrainWashing_Level5</blockHediff>
                <convertList>
                    <li>
